  "_comment": "Label-based 3-level-where-natural hierarchy spec for the MN OSA Governmental Funds sheet, consumed by scripts/loadMNOSA.js (Phase 89, MNSRC-01/02). Labels are CANONICAL (from the city cired_23 header row). The loader matches by NORMALIZED label (lowercase, strip all non-alphanumeric) so city/county spacing+case variants tie (e.g. 'Conservation ofNatural' == 'Conservation of Natural'), plus the label_aliases below for genuine typo divergences. Subtotal_label nodes use the workbook's own roll-up column as the parent total (D-03, double-count-safe); groups without a subtotal_label sum their leaves. validation_only_totals are cross-cutting roll-ups VALIDATED against but NEVER placed as nodes. Core totals only — '& Other Sources/Uses' financing lines excluded (D-05). Identity/junk columns and any label not listed here are ignored.",
