    "financial_year": "FinancialYear"
  },
  "identity_notes": "County files have NO 'GAAPInd' and NO 'ParentEntityName' columns — the loader returns null/'' when a label is absent (do not throw). entity_basis is null for counties (no basis flag in the source).",
